<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange was closed on Friday for a Buddhist holiday. Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the all share index closed 10.8 points higher at 787.4, maintaining this week's steady rise. Turnover was 330 million rupees.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
